{"id": "De5smNojeZm", "title": "Video by dynamicsourcecode", "description": "Your slow Android TV is probably full of apps you never asked for. Here's every step to fix it. \ud83d\udcfa\n\nPeople are using Claude Code to switch off bloat, ad rows and trackers on Android TV and Google TV over ADB, with no root. Everything is disabled, not deleted, so it can be undone. The catch: one user bricked a TV, you lose whatever you switch off, and 1 GB TVs may not speed up much.\n\nWould you let an AI tune your TV, or never risk it? \ud83d\udc47\nComment PROMPT and I'll send you the exact one.\n\nSources: TechCrunch, It's FOSS, Tom's Hardware, github.com/Gathin23/cleanyourtv, github.com/humblemuzzu/dumbtv, developer.android.com, code.claude.com\nOriginal animation. Not affiliated with Google, Anthropic or Amazon.\n\n#AndroidTV #GoogleTV #ClaudeCode #SmartTV #TechTips #AI #LearnTech", "channel": "dynamicsourcecode", "uploader_id": "49866947505", "uploader": "Dynamic Source Code \ud83e\uddd1\ud83c\udffb\u200d\ud83d\udcbb", "timestamp": 1792897438, "like_count": 3032, "comment_count": 125, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/146.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-18096399443659506a", "manifest_url": null, "ext": "m4a", "width": null, "height": null, "tbr": 62.531, "asr": 48000, "fps": null, "language": null, "format_note": "DASH audio", "filesize": null, "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "dynamic_range": null, "url": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOTGFj91p5Z6x00fWbFR8mdvlM9JTrlYLEiFfOxTm9N-Vyd4MIdWp8hVpf6yTCWcrLhzfJb6gvSKy29Soa7QJf49gkmgav_uWU3hw8.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=4L-A4TdC_Po